  "_note_muscleZones": "Muscle bellies for the per-movement diagram on /exercise/<id>. A SIBLING of `zones`, never a replacement: `zones` is the pain taxonomy joined into /where by problemIds, its shapes sit on joints, and editing it in place would break that page. Ids are the exercise-DB muscle strings verbatim, so the join needs no table. Do not add a region finer than these 17 — no exercise tag can select a sub-structure, so anything finer would be invented by the renderer and drawn identically on hundreds of pages."
